    ipbes:hasDescription "Felis catus (cat, top left), Vulpes vulpes (red fox, top right), Rattus spp. (rats, bottom left), Boiga irregularis (brown tree snake, bottom right). Photo credits: Mark Marathon, WM Commons – CC BY-SA 4.0 (top left) / Gregory “Slobirdr” Smith, flickr – CC BY-SA 2.0 (top right) / ngamanuimages – Copyright (bottom left) / U.S. Department of Agriculture, flickr – CC BY 2.0 (bottom right)." ;
    dcterms:identifier "Figure4.18" ;
    skos:prefLabel "Examples of terrestrial invasive alien species which can cause local or global extinctions of native species." .

