        <http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/sch/IAS23-6.2.3.5> ;
    ipbes:hasConfidenceLevel "established but incomplete" ;
    ipbes:hasDescription "In cases where the impact of invasive alien species on the quality of life of Indigenous Peoples and local communities is unavoidable, those communities need ongoing support and adequate resources to respond to the challenges of living with invasive alien species (established but incomplete) {1.6.7.2, 6.2.3.2, 6.2.3.5}." ;
    dcterms:identifier "1.6.7.2, 6.2.3.2, 6.2.3.5" .

<http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/subm/IAS23-D31-SM0> a ipbes:SubMessage ;
    ipbes:SubChapter <http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/sch/IAS23-5.4.1>,
        <http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/sch/IAS23-6.6.2.3> ;
    ipbes:hasConfidenceLevel "established but incomplete" ;
    ipbes:hasDescription "Strengthening existing open information systems can facilitate the management of biological invasions, including prioritization of actions, early detection and rapid response, and can improve the effectiveness of regulations (established but incomplete) {5.4.1, 6.6.2.3}." ;
    dcterms:identifier "5.4.1, 6.6.2.3" .

<http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/subm/IAS23-D31-SM1> a ipbes:SubMessage ;
    ipbes:Illustration <http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/il/IAS23-TableSPM.2>,
        <http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/il/IAS23-TableSPM.A1> ;
    ipbes:SubChapter <http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/sch/IAS23-6.6.2.4>,
        <http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/sch/IAS23-6.6.2.6>,
        <http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/sch/IAS23-6.6.3> ;
    ipbes:hasConfidenceLevel "well established" ;
    ipbes:hasDescription "Open information systems can substantially reduce the costs of management by ensuring targeted and appropriate responses, avoiding duplication of efforts and facilitating the evaluation of the effectiveness of policy instruments using indicators (Table SPM.2) (well established) {6.6.2.4, 6.6.2.6, 6.6.3}. The “rate of invasive alien species establishment” headline indicator adopted for monitoring progress towards Target 6 of the Kunming-Montreal Global Biodiversity Framework provides opportunities to build on existing indicators of biological invasions (Table SPM.A1) {6.6.3}." ;
    dcterms:identifier "6.6.2.4, 6.6.2.6, 6.6.3" .

<http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/subm/IAS23-D31-SM2> a ipbes:SubMessage ;
    ipbes:SubChapter <http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/sch/IAS23-6.2.3.3>,
        <http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/sch/IAS23-6.2.3.4> ;
    ipbes:hasConfidenceLevel "established but incomplete" ;
    ipbes:hasDescription "Collaboration and networking among stakeholders and governments can ensure equitable knowledge access (established but incomplete) {6.2.3.3, 6.2.3.4} and improve understanding of the context-specific features of biological invasions." ;
    dcterms:identifier "6.2.3.3, 6.2.3.4" .

<http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/subm/IAS23-D31-SM3> a ipbes:SubMessage ;
    ipbes:SubChapter <http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/sch/IAS23-6.2.3.3>,
        <http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/sch/IAS23-6.4.1>,
        <http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/sch/IAS23-6.7.2.6> ;
    ipbes:hasConfidenceLevel "established but incomplete" ;
    ipbes:hasDescription "It can also improve the availability of data and knowledge across geographic regions, habitats and taxonomic groups and reduce the wide variation in response capability (established but incomplete) {6.2.3.3, 6.4.1, 6.7.2.6}." ;
    dcterms:identifier "6.2.3.3, 6.4.1, 6.7.2.6" .

<http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/subm/IAS23-D31-SM4> a ipbes:SubMessage ;
    ipbes:SubChapter <http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/sch/IAS23-6.6.2.1> ;
    ipbes:hasConfidenceLevel "established but incomplete" ;
    ipbes:hasDescription "Through citizen science, information systems have the potential to engage people, raise awareness and increase the availability of data (established but incomplete) {6.6.2.1}." ;
