        <http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/sch/IAS23-2.6.1> ;
    ipbes:hasDescription "Dyer, E. E., Redding, D. W., & Blackburn, T. M. (2017). The global avian invasions atlas, a database of alien bird distributions worldwide. Scientific Data," ;
