        <http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/sch/IAS23-3.2.2.2> ;
    ipbes:hasDescription "Dyer, E. E., Cassey, P., Redding, D. W., Collen, B., Franks, V., Gaston, K. J., Jones, K. E., Kark, S., Orme, C. D. L., & Blackburn, T. M. (2017). The global distribution and drivers of alien bird species richness. PLoS Biology, 15(1), e2000942. https://doi." ;
