        <http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/ref/2352922/items/QGLGNGME>,
        <http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/ref/2352922/items/QSA2HIMY>,
        <http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/ref/2352922/items/R26K4P96>,
